    "text": "If the Boolean expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8859;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8855;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>)</mo></math> is a tautology, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8859;</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8855;</mo></math> are respectively given by",
